+- Text: **Mughal synthesis formula—testable pattern:** - **Garden:** Charbagh (4-part Persian garden with water channels) - **Building:** Domed mausoleum or palace (Persian iwans, Indian scale) - **Material:** White marble + parchin kari (semi-precious stone inlay) - **Proportion:** Modular grid system (mathematical harmony) - **Patrons:** Akbar (Hindu-Islamic synthesis), Shah Jahan (apex magnificence) Key building: Taj Mahal = charbagh + white marble + stone inlay + double-shell dome.
